{'symbol': 'GNRC', 'date': '2023-02-22 07:30:00', 'title': 'MEAN GREEN LAUNCHES FURY, NEW COMPACT ELECTRIC MOWER', 'text': 'ONE OF THE NARROWEST BATTERY-POWERED, STAND-ON MOWERS AVAILABLE IN MARKET WAUKESHA, WIS. , FEB. 22, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MEAN GREEN,\xa0A LEADING BATTERY-POWERED, COMMERCIAL-GRADE TURF CARE MANUFACTURER AND A\xa0GENERAC POWER SYSTEMS (NYSE: GNRC) COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE FURY, A COMPACT STAND-ON MOWER DESIGNED TO ALLOW ACCESS TO AREAS THAT MOST OTHER COMMERCIAL MOWERS ARE TOO WIDE TO ENTER.'}